---
component: ending
effects: true
params:
  who: speaker
  kind: { type: { entity: outcome } }
  title: string
---

## Record

// One place that closes a route's term: the ending, the term count, and the
// save's memory of which ending this route has reached.
::set{run.ending = @kind}
::set{user.terms += 1}
::assert{cleared(@who, @kind)}
@narrator: ~ {{@title}} ~
